              "type": "text",
              "text": "On a particular day, Dr Rosanna starts seeing patients at 8:30 am and finishes by 5:30 pm.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If she saw 40 patients that day, then what is the rate at which Dr Rosanna saw her patients, in patients/hour?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-q5-rounding",
